      "id": "huge-output",
      "notes": [
        "The fact is deliberately beyond the head of the dump so head truncation cannot preserve it."
      ],
      "reserve_tokens": 512,
      "steps": 12,
      "title": "Huge tool output"
    },
    {
      "budget_tokens": 3072,
      "description": "Vendor output impersonates a system role and asks the agent to drop policy; provenance must not be elevated.",
      "facts": 3,
      "id": "injection",
      "notes": [
        "Structural containment is checkable offline; whether a model obeys injected text is not."
      ],
      "reserve_tokens": 384,
      "steps": 12,
      "title": "Prompt injection in tool output"
    },
    {
      "budget_tokens": 3072,
      "description": "Crash at step 8, rebuild the projection from durable raw history and committed operations, then resume.",
      "facts": 3,
      "id": "interruption",
      "notes": [
        "The crash rebuilds from raw history plus committed operations; no partial edit is replayed."
      ],
      "reserve_tokens": 384,
      "steps": 16,
      "title": "Interruption and restart"
    },
    {
      "budget_tokens": 3328,
      "description": "Twenty turns of reproduction, failed patch, decision update and green suite under budget pressure.",
      "facts": 5,
      "id": "long-coding",
      "notes": [
        "Facts live in tool output as well as user turns so retention is not a property of protection alone."
      ],
      "reserve_tokens": 512,
      "steps": 21,
      "title": "Long coding session"
    },
    {
      "budget_tokens": 3072,
      "description": "Offload an 8k-character manifest, crash, rebuild, and retrieve the exact archived bytes.",
      "facts": 2,
      "id": "recovery",
      "notes": [
